 "notes": [
  "Aki 1.2.0 art region map for tools/upscale-aki-art.py (docs/DECISIONS.md D11 Remaster).",
  "Rects are QuickDraw-style [left, top, right, bottom], right/bottom exclusive. Regions never overlap.",
  "picture = 4x per region (edge-replicate padded) by its \"method\": \"remacri\" (default, AI) or \"lanczos\" (plain enlarge; tiles.png body rows, Ben's U4 ruling A1); mask = nearest 4x, bit-exact; pixels in no region = nearest 4x (unknown/unused sheet areas).",
  "\"dedither\": true = that file's only treatment is de-dithered (Gaussian 0.7 before remacri; the backgrounds, Ben's U4 ruling).",
  "misc.png y 87..117 at x 155..204 (pairsHundredsDigit(0), reachable only at >= 1000 open pairs) lies inside the time-bar stone-mask strip (3,78,428,117); it is not a digit region.",
  "layer_buttons.png has zero regions: Phase-3 editor art, its cell grid is not read yet.",
  "Coverage is enforced by Aki/Core/Tests/AkiCoreTests/ArtRegionsTests.swift against AkiGameArt / AkiMap.",
  "Every other top-level key is a PNG file name of Resources/Aki/1.2.0.app/Contents/Resources."
